# Test discipline

- Set temp `TWEETS2BSKY_DATA_DIR` **before** importing DB/config modules.
- Unit-test pure normalize/transform helpers. Integration tests isolate storage and mock/avoid live X/Bluesky.
- Do not run live smoke scripts in CI (`test:pipeline`, `test:twitter-*`, `test:ad-tweet`).
- E2E via `bun run test:e2e` only.
- After schema/pipeline/API changes, run at least: `bun run lint:check`, both typechecks, relevant unit/integration tests. Prefer `bun run check` for release-risk changes.
- Fixtures: redacted placeholders only — never real cookies/passwords.

Use skill `run-quality-gate` for the full Windows-safe command sequence.
